#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:5
msgid "Replace text field content"
msgstr "替换文本字段内容"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the feature of searching and replacing `text field`_ "
"content automatically. This option allows replacing the complete content "
"from a `text field`_ which contains the string searched. The string searched"
" can be the complete `text field`_ content or part of the `text field`_ "
"content."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了搜索和自动替换 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 内容的特性。此选项允许替换包含字符串搜索的 `文本字段 "
"<text field_>`_ 的全部内容。字符串搜索可以是完整的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 内容或 `文本字段 <text "
"field_>`_ 内容的一部分。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:14
msgid ""
"If the `search menu`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Edit > "
"Search / Replace** menu item."
msgstr "如果不显示 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_，可以从 **编辑 > 搜索/替换** 菜单项中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:17
msgid "To replace `text field`_ content over a `project`_:"
msgstr "将 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 内容替换为 `项目 <project_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:19
msgid "`Search`_ the string which should be replaced (Ex.: Folio)."
msgstr "`搜索 <Search_>`_ 应该替换的字符串(ex: Folio)."

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:24
#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:26
msgid ""
"Define the new text content at the replace text box (Ex.: Sheet reserve)."
msgstr "在替换文本框(Ex: Sheet reserve)中定义新的文本内容。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select at the objects tree the `text fields`_ which content should be "
"replaced."
msgstr "在对象树上选择应当替换的 `文本字段 <text fields_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:34
msgid ""
"Press **Replace all** button to replace the content from the selected `text "
"fields`_."
msgstr "按 **替换全部** 按钮以替换所选 `文本字段 <text fields_>`_ 的内容。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:35
msgid "Press actualize |view-refresh| button to refresh the search."
msgstr "按下实际 |view-refresh| 按钮刷新搜索。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:50
msgid "view-refresh"
msgstr "重新视图"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:39
msgid ""
"Replacing action can also be applied object by object. The button "
"**Replace** will only apply the action to the displayed object at the "
"`workspace`_. The buttons |go-top| and |go-bottom| can be used to display "
"the previous and next `text field`_ from the search result."
msgstr ""
"替换动作也可以被对象应用。 按钮 **替换** 将只在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 上将动作应用到显示的对象。 按钮 |go-top| 和 "
"|go-bottom| 可用于显示搜索结果中上下 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:49
msgid "go-top"
msgstr "上进"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:48
msgid "go-bottom"
msgstr "向下移动"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/text_field_replace.rst:45
msgid ""
"The replacing feature from QElectroTech replaces the `text field`_ content "
"completely. Changing the `text field`_ content partly cannot be done."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 的替换功能将完全替换 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 内容。 部分无法修改 `文本字段 <text "
"field_>`_ 内容 。"
